-- src:20144 | (3) A firm is to be treated as controlled by qualified persons if, and only if—
-- src:20145 | (a) a majority of the members of the firm are qualified persons, and
-- src:20146 | (b) where the firm's affairs are managed by a board of directors, committee or other management body, a majority of that body are qualified persons or, if the body consists of two persons only, at least one of them is a qualified person.
@ref sch 10 para 7(3) A firm is controlled by qualified persons if, and only if (src:20144-20146)
GIVEN `a majority of the members of the firm are qualified persons` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the affairs of the firm are managed by a board of directors, committee or other management body` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a majority of that body are qualified persons` IS A BOOLEAN
      `that body consists of two persons only` IS A BOOLEAN
      `at least one of the two is a qualified person` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 10 para 7(3) the firm is controlled by qualified persons` MEANS
    IF    `a majority of the members of the firm are qualified persons`
       AND (    (NOT `the affairs of the firm are managed by a board of directors, committee or other management body`)
             OR `a majority of that body are qualified persons`
             OR (`that body consists of two persons only` AND `at least one of the two is a qualified person`))
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A firm is to be treated as controlled by qualified persons if, and only if"

