-- src:20156 | (3) The applicant may be required to undergo further training during the adaptation period.
@ref sch 10 para 7A(3) The applicant may be required to undergo further training (src:20156-20156)
GIVEN `s 1221 Approval of third country qualifications` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 10 para 7A(3) the applicant may be required to undergo further training during the adaptation period` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 1221 Approval of third country qualifications`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "in any case within that section" (paragraph 7A(1))
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): section 1221 (coa26) decides whether the case is within it

-- src:20157 | (4) The applicant’s performance during the adaptation period must be assessed by the body.
@ref sch 10 para 7A(4) Assessment of performance by the body (src:20157-20157)
GIVEN `the performance of the applicant during the adaptation period is assessed by the body` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 10 para 7A(4) the body meets the requirement` MEANS
    IF `the performance of the applicant during the adaptation period is assessed by the body`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The applicant’s performance during the adaptation period must be assessed by the body"

