GIVEN `the body determines the applicants professional status during the adaptation period` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 10 para 7A(5) the body meets the requirement` MEANS
    IF `the body determines the applicants professional status during the adaptation period`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The body must determine the applicant’s professional status during the adaptation period"

-- ---- paragraph 8: Auditors to be fit and proper persons ----

-- src:20160 | 8 (1) The body must have adequate rules and practices designed to ensure that the persons eligible under its rules for appointment as a statutory auditor are fit and proper persons to be so appointed.
@ref sch 10 para 8(1) Fit and proper persons (src:20160-20160)
GIVEN `the body has adequate rules and practices designed to ensure that the persons eligible under its rules for appointment as a statutory auditor are fit and proper persons to be so appointed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 10 para 8(1) the body meets the requirement` MEANS
    IF `the body has adequate rules and practices designed to ensure that the persons eligible under its rules for appointment as a statutory auditor are fit and proper persons to be so appointed`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The body must have adequate rules and practices designed to ensure that the persons eligible under its rules for appointment as a statutory auditor are fit and proper persons"

DECLARE `sch 10 para 8(2) person the matter relates to` IS ONE OF
    `sch 10 para 8(2)(a) a person employed by or associated with the person for statutory audit work`
    `sch 10 para 8(2)(b)(i) a director or controller of the body corporate`
    `sch 10 para 8(2)(b)(ii) another body corporate in the same group`
    `sch 10 para 8(2)(b)(iii) a director or controller of such another body corporate`
    `sch 10 para 8(2)(c)(i) a partner`
    `sch 10 para 8(2)(c)(ii) a director or controller of a partner`
    `sch 10 para 8(2)(c)(iii) a body corporate in the same group as a partner`
    `sch 10 para 8(2)(c)(iv) a director or controller of such another body corporate in the group of a partner`
    `sch 10 para 8(2) any other person`

-- src:20161 | (2) The matters which the body may take into account for this purpose in relation to a person must include—
-- src:20162 | (a) any matter relating to any person who is or will be employed by or associated with him for the purposes of or in connection with statutory audit work;
-- src:20163 | (b) in the case of a body corporate, any matter relating to—
-- src:20164 | (i) any director or controller of the body,
-- src:20165 | (ii) any other body corporate in the same group, or
-- src:20166 | (iii) any director or controller of any such other body; and
-- src:20167 | (c) in the case of a partnership, any matter relating to—
-- src:20168 | (i) any of the partners,
-- src:20169 | (ii) any director or controller of any of the partners,
-- src:20170 | (iii) any body corporate in the same group as any of the partners, or
-- src:20171 | (iv) any director or controller of any such other body.
@ref sch 10 para 8(2) Matters the body may take into account must include (src:20161-20171)
GIVEN `the person assessed is a body corporate` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person assessed is a partnership` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the matter relates to` IS A `sch 10 para 8(2) person the matter relates to`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 10 para 8(2) the matters the body may take into account must include a matter relating to this person` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the matter relates to`
    WHEN `sch 10 para 8(2)(a) a person employed by or associated with the person for statutory audit work` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `sch 10 para 8(2)(b)(i) a director or controller of the body corporate` THEN `in the case of a body corporate`
    WHEN `sch 10 para 8(2)(b)(ii) another body corporate in the same group` THEN `in the case of a body corporate`
    WHEN `sch 10 para 8(2)(b)(iii) a director or controller of such another body corporate` THEN `in the case of a body corporate`
    WHEN `sch 10 para 8(2)(c)(i) a partner` THEN `in the case of a partnership`
    WHEN `sch 10 para 8(2)(c)(ii) a director or controller of a partner` THEN `in the case of a partnership`
    WHEN `sch 10 para 8(2)(c)(iii) a body corporate in the same group as a partner` THEN `in the case of a partnership`
    WHEN `sch 10 para 8(2)(c)(iv) a director or controller of such another body corporate in the group of a partner` THEN `in the case of a partnership`
    WHEN `sch 10 para 8(2) any other person` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "must include"
    WHERE
        `in the case of a body corporate` MEANS
            IF `the person assessed is a body corporate`
            THEN JUST TRUE
            ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "in the case of a body corporate"
        `in the case of a partnership` MEANS
            IF `the person assessed is a partnership`
            THEN JUST TRUE
            ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "in the case of a partnership"

-- src:20172 | (3) Where the person is a limited liability partnership, in sub-paragraph (2)(b) “director” is to be read as “member”.
@ref sch 10 para 8(3) A limited liability partnership: director is read as member (src:20172-20172)
GIVEN `the person is a limited liability partnership` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 10 para 8(3) director is to be read as member in sub-paragraph (2)(b)` MEANS
    IF `the person is a limited liability partnership`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Where the person is a limited liability partnership"

-- src:20173 | (4) In sub-paragraph (2)(b) and (c) “controller”, in relation to a body corporate, means a person who either alone or with an associate or associates is entitled to exercise or control the exercise of 15% or more of the rights to vote on all, or substantially all, matters at general meetings of the body or another body corporate of which it is a subsidiary.
@ref sch 10 para 8(4) Controller (src:20173-20173)
GIVEN `the person is a body corporate` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the fraction of the rights to vote on all or substantially all matters at general meetings of the body or of another body corporate of which it is a subsidiary that the person alone or with an associate or associates is entitled to exercise or control` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 10 para 8(4) the person is a controller of the body corporate` MEANS
    IF NOT `the person is a body corporate`
    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "“controller”, in relation to a body corporate"
    ELSE IF `the fraction of the rights to vote on all or substantially all matters at general meetings of the body or of another body corporate of which it is a subsidiary that the person alone or with an associate or associates is entitled to exercise or control` AT LEAST 0.15
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“controller”, in relation to a body corporate, means a person who ... 15% or more"
